"test":{"name":"rule-faction-load","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"factionLoad","question":"Loading from the Resources folder, with nothing listed on the scene's LevelEditor: the Grunt, a faction's 'Grunt Federation Variant', the City and Grassland are found by name. A scenario's Grunt placed for a Federation side becomes the Federation's version (also when saved as another faction's version); for a side without a faction it stays the Grunt. The build menu calls the version 'Grunt' (and 'Gunship Variant' 'Gunship'). On the AI's thinking thread, after the board is copied, the faction matches its units by name without a call Unity allows only on the main thread.","rules":"standard"},
